{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NTxfaLZtE5GhMT2dWkMsTE","type":"tool_result","content":"## 15. Texture helpers for floortex functions\n\n- `E.tex`: floor textures for a TileMap's floorTex(x, y), each giving [r, g, b] at a world point; as materials too: floorMat: 'grass'\n- `E.tex.checker(x, y, o = {})`: checkerboard tiles (castle floors, bonus rooms). o: { a, b, size }\n- `E.tex.dirt(x, y, o = {})`: dirt, sand or snow: base color with soft noise and specks. o: { base, dark, light }\n- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\n\n## 16. Platform map\nbrick stone rock plank timber plaster hedge speckle plain tiles slab leaves grass flagstone dirt water planks checker wood metal ground pipe block bonus oak walnut birch crate cobble marble granite sandstone slate iron steel gold copper bronze clay glazed porcelain linen burlap wool velvet leather bark needles shrub moss straw sand snow mud shingle bone ice crystal flame ruin rusted\nbarrel crate chest table chair stool bench bed bookcase shelf pot jar sack cart well sign lamppost anvil fence pine tree bush grass rock crystal\nslash backslash overhead rising thrust spin plunge twohand jab cross hook uppercut haymaker elbow kick roundhouse sweep flyingkick knee axekick cast throw bash claw\n0.85.2","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28d8cdd1-64ac-4caf-98dc-e01333dcd3b0","uuid":"f58a3115-0a15-4f75-ab2a-26902bb5129f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:08:02.587Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 15. Texture helpers for floortex functions\n\n- `E.tex`: floor textures for a TileMap's floorTex(x, y), each giving [r, g, b] at a world point; as materials too: floorMat: 'grass'\n- `E.tex.checker(x, y, o = {})`: checkerboard tiles (castle floors, bonus rooms). o: { a, b, size }\n- `E.tex.dirt(x, y, o = {})`: dirt, sand or snow: base color with soft noise and specks. o: { base, dark, light }\n- `E.tex.flagstone(x, y, pal, size = 16)`: stone flagstones with running-bond rows. pal: {stones:[hex..], mortar, hi, lo, speck}\n- `E.tex.grass(x, y, o = {})`: grass with darker tufts and a few flowers. o: { base, dark, light, flower } hex colors\n- `E.tex.plain(x, y, o = {})`: plain color with light noise, for roads, carpets and space floors. o: { base, amount }\n- `E.tex.planks(x, y, o = {})`: wooden floor boards running along x. o: { base, dark, line }\n- `E.tex.water(x, y, o = {})`: water with static ripple lines (baked, so it does not move). o: { base, dark, light }\n\n## 16. Platform map\nbrick stone rock plank timber plaster hedge speckle plain tiles slab leaves grass flagstone dirt water planks checker wood metal ground pipe block bonus oak walnut birch crate cobble marble granite sandstone slate iron steel gold copper bronze clay glazed porcelain linen burlap wool velvet leather bark needles shrub moss straw sand snow mud shingle bone ice crystal flame ruin rusted\nbarrel crate chest table chair stool bench bed bookcase shelf pot jar sack cart well sign lamppost anvil fence pine tree bush grass rock crystal\nslash backslash overhead rising thrust spin plunge twohand jab cross hook uppercut haymaker elbow kick roundhouse sweep flyingkick knee axekick cast throw bash claw\n0.85.2","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NTxfaLZtE5GhMT2dWkMsTE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
